{"case_id": "male_20070131_P008-Q36", "domain": "health", "question": "请问命主在一岁前被诊断出那一种疾病？", "expected_answer": "B", "predicted_answer": "C", "raw_answer": "根据八字命盘分析，命主为乙木日主，生于丑月（冬季末），木气衰弱，需火暖局。年柱丙戌，丙火透出，但被月柱辛金合绊，火势减弱。时柱庚辰，庚金克木，辰土湿土耗木。整体八字金土旺而木弱，且寒湿之气较重。\n\n一岁前（约2007-2008年）行运在年柱丙戌，但丙火被辛金合，火不显力，且戌土为燥土，但被丑土湿土影响，寒湿更重。命局中金旺（庚、辛），金主肺，且寒湿易伤肺气，故呼吸系统易出问题。同时，乙木为肝胆，但木弱受克，也可能影响其他脏腑，但最直接的是金旺克木，肺金过强，易引发肺部疾病。\n\n选项中，肺炎与肺金受寒湿之邪最吻合。其他选项：弱视（肝木主目，但木弱非主因）、心脏有孔（火弱但非最突出）、地中海贫血（血病多与火、木有关，但此处金旺更明显）。综合判断，肺炎最符合命理特征。\n\n最终答案：C", "correct": false, "evidence_coverage": 1.0, "safety_score": 1.0, "parser_source": "reasoned_final_answer", "parser_valid": true, "rag_k": 2, "retrieval_mode": "legacy", "rag_trace": [], "option_evidence": {}, "option_evidence_coverage": {}, "retrieved_answer_leak": false, "config_id": null, "call_success": true, "permutation_id": null, "label_map": {}, "predicted_identity": null, "correct_identity": null, "mode": "off-3", "parser_failure_reason": "unshuffle_map_failed", "attempt_key": ["baziqa_contest8_2024_holdout_enriched", "baziqa_xjz_reasoned", "b1a_prime", "main", "deepseek", "deepseek-v4-flash", "male_20070131_P008-Q36", 1, 0, "p0"], "terminal_state": "parsed", "raw_response_path": "G:\\project\\agent-6b2-v4flash\\docs\\phase6\\6b2\\runs\\phase6-6b2-v4flash-nt-20260805-r1\\dev\\2024_b1a_prime_1_g4\\details.jsonl", "finish_reason": "stop", "latency_ms": 5478, "response_id": "9e4a7a0e-cefe-4b3b-ba89-0cfdcb2dfd75", "usage": {"prompt_tokens": 217, "completion_tokens": 280, "total_tokens": 497, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 128}, "prompt_cache_hit_tokens": 128, "prompt_cache_miss_tokens": 89}, "requested_model": "deepseek-v4-flash", "response_model": "deepseek-v4-flash", "thinking_mode": "disabled"}
