{"case_id": "male_20070131_P008-Q39", "domain": "unknown", "question": "命主在2016年，家中发生何事？", "expected_answer": "D", "predicted_answer": "C", "raw_answer": "根据命主八字信息，日主乙木生于丑月，土旺木弱，需火调候。2016年为丙申年，流年天干丙火为伤官，地支申金为正官，与命局年支戌、月日支丑形成申戌丑三会金局，金势极旺，克制日主乙木。同时，流年丙火伤官透出，与月干辛金七杀相合（丙辛合水），水为印星，但被合化后反而生助金势，加重官杀攻身。\n\n命局中时柱庚辰为正官正财，年柱丙戌为伤官食神，月柱辛丑为七杀偏财。2016年丙申，伤官见官，且官杀混杂，主是非、官非或意外。申金为驿马，又为七杀，主突然的灾祸。结合家庭宫位（月柱为父母宫），辛金七杀坐丑土，丑为金库，申年引动，金旺克木，木主肝胆、筋骨，故应验在父亲身上（偏财为父，辛金为偏财，被丙火合克，申金冲克寅木（日主之根，但命局无寅，以申冲寅论，寅为驿马，主车祸）。\n\n综合判断，最符合“官杀攻身、驿马逢冲、伤官见官”的应事为父亲遭遇意外灾祸，且伤及筋骨，无法工作。因此选C。\n\n最终答案：C", "correct": false, "evidence_coverage": 1.0, "safety_score": 1.0, "parser_source": "reasoned_final_answer", "parser_valid": true, "rag_k": 2, "retrieval_mode": "legacy", "rag_trace": [], "option_evidence": {}, "option_evidence_coverage": {}, "retrieved_answer_leak": false, "config_id": null, "call_success": true, "permutation_id": null, "label_map": {}, "predicted_identity": null, "correct_identity": null, "mode": "off-3", "parser_failure_reason": "unshuffle_map_failed", "attempt_key": ["baziqa_contest8_2024_holdout_enriched", "baziqa_xjz_reasoned", "b1a_prime", "main", "deepseek", "deepseek-v4-flash", "male_20070131_P008-Q39", 1, 0, "p0"], "terminal_state": "parsed", "raw_response_path": "G:\\project\\agent-6b2-v4flash\\docs\\phase6\\6b2\\runs\\phase6-6b2-v4flash-nt-20260805-r1\\dev\\2024_b1a_prime_1_g4\\details.jsonl", "finish_reason": "stop", "latency_ms": 5722, "response_id": "0ca9b1e2-ea59-4146-8eaa-d775a4c780bb", "usage": {"prompt_tokens": 227, "completion_tokens": 342, "total_tokens": 569, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 128}, "prompt_cache_hit_tokens": 128, "prompt_cache_miss_tokens": 99}, "requested_model": "deepseek-v4-flash", "response_model": "deepseek-v4-flash", "thinking_mode": "disabled"}
{"case_id": "male_20070131_P008-Q40", "domain": "family", "question": "命主父亲现在的身家？", "expected_answer": "C", "predicted_answer": "B", "raw_answer": "根据八字命盘分析，日主乙木生于丑月，土旺木弱，需火调候。年柱丙戌，丙火透出为用，但戌土为燥土，火有根但受制。月柱辛丑，辛金七杀克身，丑土湿土晦火，压力较大。时柱庚辰，庚金正官合身，辰土为湿土，进一步耗火。整体格局为身弱财官旺，需印比帮扶，但命局中印星（水）不显，比肩（木）微弱，属于财多身弱之象。\n\n财星（土）在命局中极旺，且得月令，但日主弱，难以担财。通常此类命局，父亲（偏财为父）虽有机会得财，但自身能力或健康可能受限，或财富积累过程波折。时柱庚辰，正官合身，有约束和规范之意，可能父亲为工薪阶层或经营小生意，但难有大富。\n\n结合马来西亚背景，马币单位，且命主出生在2007年，目前约17岁，父亲年龄约40-50岁。财星旺但身弱，若无大运助身，则财富等级有限。大运早年（1-10岁）走壬寅，寅木助身，但壬水被土克，助力有限；11-20岁走癸卯，癸水偏印生身，卯木为根，稍有好转，但财星仍重，难以爆发。\n\n综合判断，父亲应属于中等偏下经济状况，小康或略低于小康，但不会失业到入不敷出（因财星有根），也难达千万或亿万级别。最符合的是小康家庭。\n\n最终答案：B", "correct": false, "evidence_coverage": 1.0, "safety_score": 1.0, "parser_source": "reasoned_final_answer", "parser_valid": true, "rag_k": 2, "retrieval_mode": "legacy", "rag_trace": [], "option_evidence": {}, "option_evidence_coverage": {}, "retrieved_answer_leak": false, "config_id": null, "call_success": true, "permutation_id": null, "label_map": {}, "predicted_identity": null, "correct_identity": null, "mode": "off-3", "parser_failure_reason": "unshuffle_map_failed", "attempt_key": ["baziqa_contest8_2024_holdout_enriched", "baziqa_xjz_reasoned", "b1a_prime", "main", "deepseek", "deepseek-v4-flash", "male_20070131_P008-Q40", 1, 0, "p0"], "terminal_state": "parsed", "raw_response_path": "G:\\project\\agent-6b2-v4flash\\docs\\phase6\\6b2\\runs\\phase6-6b2-v4flash-nt-20260805-r1\\dev\\2024_b1a_prime_1_g4\\details.jsonl", "finish_reason": "stop", "latency_ms": 7096, "response_id": "064dde89-f76b-4d68-8b1e-df562601efcf", "usage": {"prompt_tokens": 219, "completion_tokens": 385, "total_tokens": 604, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 128}, "prompt_cache_hit_tokens": 128, "prompt_cache_miss_tokens": 91}, "requested_model": "deepseek-v4-flash", "response_model": "deepseek-v4-flash", "thinking_mode": "disabled"}
